  "body": "Some homes simply have a presence about them.\r\n\r\nPrivately positioned above Lake Pupuke, this exceptional family residence captures breathtaking views across the lake to Rangitoto Island and the sparkling Hauraki Gulf beyond. Designed to embrace its coveted north facing position, the home is bathed in natural light and offers effortless indoor outdoor living from the expansive entertaining deck to the heated swimming pool below.\r\n\r\nSpanning approximately 406m² on a 936m² freehold site, the home offers four generous bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms and multiple living areas, including a versatile theatre room that could also serve as a dance studio, gym or games room. Beautifully maintained and thoughtfully designed, it combines timeless craftsmanship with the opportunity to add your own personal style.\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Takapuna's most sought after neighbourhoods, you'll enjoy privacy, premium school zoning and easy access to Takapuna Beach, cafés, shopping and motorway connections.\r\n\r\nWhy you'll love living here:\r\n• Panoramic views over Lake Pupuke, Rangitoto Island and the Hauraki Gulf\r\n• Heated swimming pool and seamless indoor outdoor entertaining\r\n• 406m² home on a 936m² freehold site\r\n• Four bedrooms, three bathrooms and multiple living spaces\r\n• Triple internal access garaging, wine cellar and off street parking for a boat or motorhome\r\n• Zoned for Takapuna School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Westlake Boys', Westlake Girls' and Takapuna Grammar School\r\n\r\nWith the owners having already relocated overseas, this is a genuine opportunity to secure an exceptional home in one of Takapuna's most tightly held locations.\r\n\r\nViewings are by private appointment only.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your exclusive viewing.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
